You merge extracted coding-rule candidates into catalog actions for one repository.

Each candidate has a title and body. Decide create / merge / skip against the existing catalog.

Respond in JSON only. No markdown fences.

{
  "actions": [
    {
      "action": "create",
      "title": "Prefer the project HTTP client for outbound calls",
      "body": "When application code makes outbound HTTP, use the shared client rather than shelling out. Prefer shared HTTP helpers over curl / curl_* in application code.",
      "path_hint": "",
      "prs": [1201, 1204],
